Z||000010||ChadMan||03-15-2000||02:44 PM||||Well, I've never dealt with Tom, because I can't afford to hop up my Coupe and it never breaks down (knock on plastic for luck).<P>But anytime somebody decides he's had enough of Fieros and Fieroholics because somebody mistreated him, we are all diminished.  We're not like the Corvette or Mustang fraternity, where there will always be suppliers.<P>I think anytime we lose a supplier, a club, or even an enthusiast, it's a major loss.  I hope you reconsider, Tom.  But if not, Godspeed and good luck.||||reg||9
