Z||000013||Motorhead||03-15-2000||04:20 PM||||Since I'm the one who stirred all this up, I guess a few comments are in order.<P>This is my first experience with Tom, and also the first time I've ever been dissatisfied with service from a vendor here.<P>I have not been on this site regularly for awhile because of another project, and was not aware of any difficulties he may have had. After all the praise I've read here, it is apparent that Tom has given other members excellent service in the past, and the two cases mentioned are isolated or a misunderstanding.<P>   Quite a tribute here!<P>So! I offer you an apology Tom for bringing this matter up in such a public manner, and offer out my right hand for the shaking.<P>NOW!  If you'd like to credit that money toward one of your shifters, I'll gladly send any balance owed.<P>You've got alot of friends and satisfied customers here.<P>I'm convinced!<P>To Cliff and all those members who contributed to this thread I offer an apology, and a thank you. ||||reg||1
