Z||000015||Racer 1||03-15-2000||05:44 PM||||<B>TOM</B> I read what happened on the other thread. I can see both sides of the road here. Sometimes things dont go smoothly and some people cant wait for there stuff. Dont let it get you down just pay what you owe the people. Sounds from the prev replies  about you your a alright kinda guy. No need to leave the forum.<P>||||reg||10
Z||000016||Gokart||03-15-2000||08:38 PM||||I hadn't had my GT for a month yet when I noticed a gentleman named "TOM" was selling short shifters here at the forum. Sent out a check and he must have sent the shifter out before receiving it cause I got it three days later! Sent him $50.00 for a door window glass and when I purchased my parts car I didn't need it anymore. Asked him if I could put it towards his trunk scoop instead and ended up selling me the last one he had that he was going to put ON HIS OWN FIERO! Also GAVE ME a power mirror switch when I told him my power mirrors weren't working. Hope you don't go Tom. Your good people!<p>[This message has been edited by Gokart (edited 03-16-2000).]||||reg||12
Z||000017||WKDFIRO||03-15-2000||09:38 PM||||Your loss is one that all of us will pay dearly for. I would still like to let you know that the invitation is still open to you as a Fiero Owner to stop by and hang out with us at Fieros West! <P>Even though things are a bit crazy for you right now we would hope that if you are ever in Orange county on the first Saturday of any month you would stop by and introduce yourself and just hang among Fiero friends. Good luck and best fortune to yours.<P>PS If by chance, you are interested in the Fiero Tour this Friday just give me an e-mail!||||reg||6
Z||000018||V6pack||03-15-2000||10:57 PM||||Well Tom, it seems that everyone but a couple of people have had a good experience with you.  I appreciate the testamonials and would like to write one too..... if only I were one of those lucky people.<P>My single experience was much different.  You still have my money, going on two months now.  I told you what I intended to do and you invited me to do it.  You can't have it both ways.  Or maybe you can!  You still have my money don't you, and a loyal following..........so you win after all.<P>I give up folks.  Forgive my last attempt to recover what I lost. I'm glad I could give to your favorite charity. I apologize to the members, Mr. Pennock, and the poor unfortunate whose thread I derailed, and finally, to the fine fellow who recommended Tom.....for his trouble. <P>Come to think of it Tom, I might still settle for an apology, or parts, for my lost time and $.  But.... then again, I have a feeling that that also would be a little too much for you to part with. <P>Let me know if you need more $, and I'll try and get it right out to you.  No need to send it back.  Sorry I haven't donated for a couple of months.....I'm a little short right now! :-))<P>V6pack  ||||reg||14
Z||000019||TOM||03-16-2000||12:09 AM||||You already said you received the first half of the refund but it hasent cleared the back yet. So you do have some of the money back. You should have just cashed it and you would have known it was good. I have tried to appoligize for the circumstances but you state that I have not. Should I just send you some random parts like the post says or do you have something in mind like the trunk scoop you asked about. It is quite obvious that an appology and a refund and more on top of that will still not make you happy, and dont every call me charity. You dont know me and you never will. Thank the godess for small favors. I have done alot of business with alot of great people. Yourself excluded. ||||reg||1
Z||000020||V6pack||03-16-2000||01:14 AM||||This is my last reply Tom.  You have never apologized once for the long unfilled order or the long wait for a refund.  Hood scoops don't have much to do with anything that I can see.<P>It is real simple....No parts for 32 days. No full refund for more 24 days and counting. No apology. Just attitude and excuses!<P>Let's see.  So far you have wished my Father dead, and I believe @$$hole was in your last mail to me. And, you don't wish to know me....very immature stuff, all in all.<P>You dance all around the problem.  Where is the rest of my money????? Why try to win a beauty contest here? What can you offer to hold up your end?  Maybe I'm not the only one interested in what you end up doing in the end.  <P>Let's see....how about an e-mail to me saying something like....Hey, let's end this.  Why don't I send you a short shifter(quickly)instead of the $100. and maybe we can move on?  Then I say sure... thank you on the forum for all to see, and it's over. Simple!<P>This was just a pissing contest and I can see that no one cares about my problem... and who the hell am I to pick on Tom anyway?<P>I am amazed that all you really have to say is why isn't your bank account showing a cashed check.  You are mad about that when I'm the one waiting for the rest of my money?  What's up with that?<P>Whatever Tom....like I said, I'm done.  Make it right or don't...your choice. <BR>I have to stop because we have both made fools of ourselves in front of these good people.  You, because you think it is fun to keep me waiting forever, and me because I don't.  I apologize for the charity remark. It was inaccurate. I really wanted to use another description.<P>Guys...excuse us please.  Tom will get in a nasty shot or two and then it will be all over. Thanks for the space. <BR>V6pack<BR>||||reg||5
